inding3\\\", \\\"finding4\\\".\\n\\nAlso compute the difference between your results and the original analysis results in `output/evidence/summary.json`. If differences exceed 1% for any numeric value, note them.\\n\\nUse Python with numpy, scipy, pandas. Write and execute the code. Save all outputs.\", \"run_in_background\": true}", "output": "[{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Async agent launched successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the agentId below, into a user-facing reply.)\\nagentId: a86e00f61c6dacc8f (internal ID - do not mention to user. Use SendMessage with to: 'a86e00f61c6dacc8f', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent.)\\nThe agent is working in the background. You will be notified automatically when it completes. You know nothing about its results until that notification arrives — do not report, assume, or predict them; continue other work or respond to the user in the meantime.\\nDo not duplicate this agent's work — avoid working with the same files or topics it is using.\\noutput_file: [workspace] NOT Read or tail this file via the shell tool — it is the full subagent JSONL transcript and reading it will overflow your context. If the user asks for progress, say the agent is still running; you'll get a completion notification.\"}]", "status": "completed", "is_async": true, "tool_use_id": "call_cd7d4a0a42064016ac6f0d30"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:16:53.407777+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:16:58.718240+00:00"}}

