655020452346467849948519885072733489996609475470161870848.000000, p=8.50e-11\n\nWorkplace15:\n  Linear: slope=-0.032561, intercept=0.067427, R²=0.647380, p=1.95e-15\n  Power-law: a=0.002973, b=-3.768762, R²=-18281506543018271873857950283955364063327937748218171654646214917370295097695912896765173409851778197645950976.000000, p=1.53e-19\n\nUpdated results saved to [workspace]\n\n============================================================\nCOMPARISON WITH ORIGINAL RESULTS\n============================================================\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"[workspace]\", line 288, in <module>\n    orig_bp_mf = original.get(\"meanfield\", {}).get(\"segmented_Bc\", None)\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'list' object has no attribute 'get'", "status": "failed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_691e9a9cf48d468eaf3395f1"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:20:13.461187+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:20:17.115577+00:00"}}

