id: 728
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 728, "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "data": {"id": "4ec749a6-3803-4327-8164-a73005191de5", "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "kind": "text", "position": 727, "revision": 728, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All deliverables are in place. The validation passed with `passed: true`, zero errors, and zero warnings. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Task Complete\n\n**Analysis executed:** Core analysis (`working/analysis.py`) and robustness checks (`working/robustness.py`) both ran successfully.\n\n**4 registered findings in `output/Result.md`:**\n1."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.253100+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.786145+00:00"}}

id: 729
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 729, "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "data": {"id": "4ec749a6-3803-4327-8164-a73005191de5", "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "kind": "text", "position": 727, "revision": 729, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All deliverables are in place. The validation passed with `passed: true`, zero errors, and zero warnings. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Task Complete\n\n**Analysis executed:** Core analysis (`working/analysis.py`) and robustness checks (`working/robustness.py`) both ran successfully.\n\n**4 registered findings in `output/Result.md`:**\n1. **V(B) segmented transition** — Delay growth velocity decreases with buffer parameter B, with a change-point near Bc ≈ 3.6–4.0 (LOO stability analysis shows this may be smooth rather than sharp)\n2"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.253100+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:41.304327+00:00"}}

id: 730
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 730, "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "data": {"id": "4ec749a6-3803-4327-8164-a73005191de5", "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "kind": "text", "position": 727, "revision": 730, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All deliverables are in place. The validation passed with `passed: true`, zero errors, and zero warnings. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Task Complete\n\n**Analysis executed:** Core analysis (`working/analysis.py`) and robustness checks (`working/robustness.py`) both ran successfully.\n\n**4 registered findings in `output/Result.md`:**\n1. **V(B) segmented transition** — Delay growth velocity decreases with buffer parameter B, with a change-point near Bc ≈ 3.6–4.0 (LOO stability analysis shows this may be smooth rather than sharp)\n2. **ACF collapse** — Autocorrelation functions collapse under lag rescaling across 5 buffer conditions (R² > 0.999 for most pairs)\n3. **Finite-size scaling** — Critical buffer Bc scales with system size N"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.253100+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:41.837006+00:00"}}

id: 731
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 731, "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "data": {"id": "4ec749a6-3803-4327-8164-a73005191de5", "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "kind": "text", "position": 727, "revision": 731, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All deliverables are in place. The validation passed with `passed: true`, zero errors, and zero warnings. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Task Complete\n\n**Analysis executed:** Core analysis (`working/analysis.py`) and robustness checks (`working/robustness.py`) both ran successfully.\n\n**4 registered findings in `output/Result.md`:**\n1. **V(B) segmented transition** — Delay growth velocity decreases with buffer parameter B, with a change-point near Bc ≈ 3.6–4.0 (LOO stability analysis shows this may be smooth rather than sharp)\n2. **ACF collapse** — Autocorrelation functions collapse under lag rescaling across 5 buffer conditions (R² > 0.999 for most pairs)\n3. **Finite-size scaling** — Critical buffer Bc scales with system size N via Bc(N) = Bc∞ + a·N^(-1/ν), with ν ≈ 3.2–3.5 and R² > 0.9998; B"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.253100+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:42.353672+00:00"}}

id: 734
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 734, "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "data": {"id": "4ec749a6-3803-4327-8164-a73005191de5", "run_id": "run_cd4c0444c4ea40cc", "kind": "text", "position": 727, "revision": 734, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All deliverables are in place. The validation passed with `passed: true`, zero errors, and zero warnings. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Task Complete\n\n**Analysis executed:** Core analysis (`working/analysis.py`) and robustness checks (`working/robustness.py`) both ran successfully.\n\n**4 registered findings in `output/Result.md`:**\n1. **V(B) segmented transition** — Delay growth velocity decreases with buffer parameter B, with a change-point near Bc ≈ 3.6–4.0 (LOO stability analysis shows this may be smooth rather than sharp)\n2. **ACF collapse** — Autocorrelation functions collapse under lag rescaling across 5 buffer conditions (R² > 0.999 for most pairs)\n3. **Finite-size scaling** — Critical buffer Bc scales with system size N via Bc(N) = Bc∞ + a·N^(-1/ν), with ν ≈ 3.2–3.5 and R² > 0.9998; Bc∞ ≈ 3.84–3.86\n4. **Real-network validation** — Workplace15 and Thiers13 show buffer-dependent delay consistent with simulations (Thiers13 R² = 0.877 linear, 0.951 exponential)\n\n**Validation:** `python3 validate_output.py output` → `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n**Independent replication:** Sub-agent completed independently; all values match within floating-point precision."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:40.253100+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:21:43.155050+00:00"}}

